@AGENTS.md

## Claude Code

- Skills: `.claude/skills/` links to the shared `.agents/skills/`; a `$skill` mention in AGENTS.md
  is the `/skill` command here (e.g. `/implement`).
- Subagents: `.claude/agents/` (`architect`, `test-engineer`, `reviewer`, `security-auditor`): the
  subagent roles of AGENTS.md, with hyphens instead of underscores.
- Project permissions live in `.claude/settings.json`; personal overrides go in
  `.claude/settings.local.json` (not committed).
